 "notes": [
  "Kit batch 2005+ (lane kit-batch-2005-20261121), hand-authored from the archived crops. Group 0: panel 7 (N, 29 m, Bos en Lommerweg) from w09-15 2019-12-10, 7 window columns plus a blank bay at the balcony corner. Group 1: panel 6 surface 215 (E, 16.5 m) from w02-105 2020-05-14, 4 columns. Group 2: panels 175/47/178 (north module, 3DBAG eaves 19.4 at the canopy) from w02-105 2020-05-14, split 3+4 bays so each half keeps its own eaves. Group 3: panel 106 surface 236 from w06-105 2022-04-19. Group 4: panel 171 from w07-105 2024-09-18 and w07-105L 2021-03-29. Groups 5-6: panels 216 and 39 from w05-105 2020-05-14. Group 7: panel 71 from w08-105L 2018-12-20 and w08-105 2025-07-02 (tree). Groups 8-11: the four dark stair stubs (surfaces 185/132/166/89) from w02, w06, w07, w05, one group each so each carries its white surrounds. Group 12: the south tower's east face (panels 28/113/95/101), from the lower part in w08-105L/w08-105 and w11-195L 2021-03-29 (oblique), split in two so each half keeps its 3DBAG eaves (47.6 and 43.2); its other faces fall to otherWalls. Group 13: the setback storey under the roof canopy (panels 108/187/42).",
  "Module rhythm read on every module: ground door pairs alternating with windows, dark first storey with deep white surrounds, loggias on storeys 2-4 with white slit windows at the left of alternate loggias (storeys 2 and 4 on odd bays, storey 3 on even bays).",
  "Where 3DBAG puts the eaves at the canopy (19.4 m) the module takes a sixth storey for the setback top floor; where it stops at the parapet (16.4 m) five storeys."
